{"id":"6c59f4db569f49e9","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-T-closure.md","title":"T-闭合","display":"df-T-closure — T-闭合","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-T-closure","aliases":["91-df-T-closure","91-df-truth-closure"],"display":"df-T-closure — T-闭合","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-T-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-T-closure</span><span>91-df-truth-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-T-closure — T-闭合"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-T-closure-—-T-闭包-$\\operatorname{TCl}$\">df-T-closure — T-闭包 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TCl}\">\\(\\operatorname{TCl}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}\">\\(\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}\\)</span> (句子集)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Closed}_{T}(\\Psi)\\coloneqq\n\\Psi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Psi\\,\n\\bigl(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\in\\Psi\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Closed}_{T}(\\Psi)\\coloneqq\n\\Psi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Psi\\,\n\\bigl(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\in\\Psi\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}T\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TCl}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{\\Psi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\n\\Phi\\subseteq\\Psi\\land\\operatorname{Closed}_{T}(\\Psi)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}T\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TCl}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{\\Psi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\n\\Phi\\subseteq\\Psi\\land\\operatorname{Closed}_{T}(\\Psi)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TCl}\">\\(\\operatorname{TCl}\\)</span> : T-闭包算子（Truth-closure operator）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> : 句子集合</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Closed}_{T}(\\Phi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Closed}_{T}(\\Phi)\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 是 T-闭的</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TCl}(\\Phi)\">\\(\\operatorname{TCl}(\\Phi)\\)</span>：包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 的最小 T-闭句子集</li>\n</ul>\n<p>T-闭合的含义：\nT-闭合是包含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>且对“给句子加一层真理谓词”封闭的最小句子集。它不把<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\Phi\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\)</span>错误地解释为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>也必须真。</p>\n<p>T-闭合与组合真理的关系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>T-闭合只处理从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 到\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span> 的一元迭代</li>\n<li>组合公理处理联结词和量词，既不等同于也不由本闭合定义自动推出</li>\n<li>具有正内省子句的固定点是 T-闭合的典型实例</li>\n</ul>\n<p>T-闭合在真理理论中的应用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>最小固定点是否 T-闭合由具体跳跃的真理原子子句证明，不是其最小性本身</li>\n<li>真理归纳是关于数值变量的归纳模式，不以 T-闭合作为定义前提</li>\n<li>KF 的真理迭代条款与 FS 的捕获规则可产生相关闭合后果，但证明方式不同</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-T-closure-—-T-闭包-$\\operatorname{TCl}$","text":"df-T-closure — T-闭包 $\\operatorname{TCl}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (真理谓词, see [[91-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{TCl}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Closed}_{T}(\\Psi)\\coloneqq\n\\Psi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Psi\\,\n\\bigl(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\in\\Psi\\bigr),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}T\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TCl}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{\\Psi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\n\\Phi\\subseteq\\Psi\\land\\operatorname{Closed}_{T}(\\Psi)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TCl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Closed}_{T}(\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TCl}(\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false}],"bytes":1884,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema